/Title (Reading is the first rung of the educational ladder: children learn to read, then read to learn. Children who fall behind often stay behind, and many drop out: across Ethiopia, India, Peru and Vietnam, scoring one standard deviation lower at age 8 doubled the odds of leaving school by age 12 \(Kaffenberger, Sobol and Spindelman, 2021\). In India, more children now attend school, but learning levels have stagnated for a decade.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2742 0 R
/Next 2780 0 R
>>
